      {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "7404469334405939201",
        "linkedinUrl": "https://www.linkedin.com/posts/mama-earth-in_mamaearth-turns-9-activity-7404469334405939201-AKvD",
        "content": "Turning 9 doesn’t just mark time passed. It marks time used - to grow, to listen, to learn, and to act. As a brand born out of purpose, we’ve always believed that goodness must extend beyond our products and into the world that uses them.\n\nAs we looked around, we saw a city we love struggling to breathe. Gurugram’s air quality has been a harsh reminder of how deeply our environment shapes our everyday lives.\n\nSo instead of celebrating our anniversary with fanfare, we chose to stand with the community that has stood with us for nine years. From 8-14 December, Mamaearth is deploying anti-smog guns across schools, hospitals, colleges, and busy city routes - places where every bit of cleaner air can make a difference.\n\nThis effort sits on a foundation close to our heart with over 1 million trees planted and 13000+ tonnes of plastic recycled. 🌳 \n\nBecause goodness, to us, has always been more than a brand belief. It’s the quiet, everyday work of trying to leave things better than we found them.\n\nOn our 9th birthday, we’re not just marking a milestone - we’re reaffirming a promise.\n\nTo care. To act. To show up when it matters most. 💚🍃",
